msgid "Running CMS"
msgstr "Ejecutar CMS"

msgid ""
"On a Docker deployment the services are started by the :doc:`helper "
"scripts <docker-scripts>` and supervised by supervisord inside the "
"``cms`` container (the Ranking Web Server runs in its own ``ranking`` "
"container); you do not run them by hand. In this fork most services run "
"on Python's asyncio instead of gevent; the Worker and the Ranking Web "
"Server still use gevent."
msgstr ""
"En un despliegue con Docker, los servicios los inician los "
":doc:`scripts auxiliares <docker-scripts>` y los supervisa "
"supervisord dentro del contenedor ``cms`` (el Ranking Web Server se "
"ejecuta en su propio contenedor ``ranking``); no los ejecutas a mano. "
"En este fork la mayoría de los servicios corren sobre asyncio de "
"Python en lugar de gevent; el Worker y el Ranking Web Server siguen "
"usando gevent."

